tant; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_ea3c984aad49fd2b-320&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Corrección:&lt;/b&gt; Incorporar la entidad &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Estudiante&lt;/code&gt; y añadir explícitamente las multiplicidades &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;n a m&lt;/b&gt; en las relaciones de reservas y &lt;b style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;n a n&lt;/b&gt; en asistencias&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !im